						<p>
							Shows a higher violation rate under parametric
							Normal and Monte Carlo VaR than the theoretical
							5% baseline target.
						</p>

					</div>

				</div>


				<div>

					<span>
						03
					</span>

					<div>

						<strong>
							GLD
						</strong>

						<p>
							Rejects normality despite its different market
							exposure, reinforcing that hedge assets should
							not automatically be modeled as Gaussian.
						</p>

					</div>

				</div>


				<div>

					<span>
						04
					</span>

					<div>

						<strong>
							VIX
						</strong>

						<p>
							Provides a separate market-stress variable for
							interpreting the conditions surrounding
							violation events.
						</p>

					</div>

				</div>

			</div>

		</div>

	</div>


