	<div class="project-block">

		<div class="project-label">
			Takeaway
		</div>

		<div class="project-main">

			<h2>
				Risk has both magnitude and duration.
			</h2>

			<p class="lead">
				VaR provides an important view of downside severity,
				but it does not describe the full experience of a loss.
			</p>

			<p>
				By connecting VaR violations with recovery events,
				the project reframes risk as both a tail-probability
				problem and a time-to-recovery problem.
			</p>

			<p>
